# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings, on every OS.
#
# Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true) wrote CRLF into the working
# copy while the repository stores LF, and prettier -- which expects LF --
# reported every line of every file: ~44,000 of the ~47,000 `npm run lint`
# errors were this one mismatch, burying the real ones.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
